//RS /// D-TYPE2-TIME1=A: the normalization scale for each registered budget unit.
//RS /// Time suffixes are canonical `core.units::Time` members and normalize to the
//RS /// i64-nanosecond carrier (D-TIMERES1); byte suffixes normalize to bytes.
//RS /// This registered row is the only scale table — no compiler pass keeps a
//RS /// private duration suffix table.
